{"id":"659346","name":"白腐乳菠菜","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659346/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"白腐乳","amount":"3块"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"480克"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：白腐乳、菠菜。","img":"images/659346/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取白腐乳3块放入碗中。","img":"images/659346/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"接着，用勺子捣碎。","img":"images/659346/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将菠菜去根洗净捞出。","img":"images/659346/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放在案板上切开。","img":"images/659346/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"随后，在清水加适量的盐。","img":"images/659346/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加适量的油。","img":"images/659346/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮开。","img":"images/659346/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"接着，下入切开的菠菜焯一下捞出。","img":"images/659346/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"用清水过过凉。","img":"images/659346/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"然后，将过凉好的菠菜控干水分。","img":"images/659346/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"起锅倒油烧热，下入菠菜加入捣碎的白腐乳。","img":"images/659346/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒翻炒即成。","img":"images/659346/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}